210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Dear Vineyard Residents,)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the fifth month of Discover Your Home, we recently came together to celebrate the power of collaboration and community spirit during our second annual Mayor Impact Vineyard Awards Ceremony. Following this uplifting event, we hosted the Impact Vineyard Community Fair, further emphasizing our commitment to fostering connections within our community. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Reflecting on the remarkable achievements recognized at Impact Vineyard, the eagerly anticipated economic development initiative of enhancing safety brings even more positive change to our area. It sets a new standard for the fire department, exemplifying our commitment to progressive development and service excellence.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Among these endeavors is the construction of Vineyard's inaugural firehouse in the Cottonwoods neighborhood. This significant undertaking has been years in the making, marked by diligent financial planning and thorough studies, culminating in the establishment of the budget last July. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (From meticulous design considerations to site selection, every aspect has been carefully thought out. Vineyard is not just building a life-saving resource; we're creating a hub, a cornerstone of community engagement and civic pride. This endeavor enhances our public safety and fosters a sense of unity and collaboration in our Lindon, Orem, Vineyard fire services partnership. It sets a new standard for the fire department, exemplifying our commitment to progressive development and service excellence.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
