220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The fire Chief spoke about how thoughtful his operators are about sound in the night and how they work with the community to make it the best fit. They offered upcoming town halls and joined us at our Vineyard Impact fair, April 25th where they shared more with the community. The design of the firehouse is now on its way to the planning commission. We look forward to the development and were given a timeline of 9 months after approvals. )
/E (The fire Chief spoke about how thoughtful his operators are about sound in the night and how they work with the community to make it the best fit. They offered upcoming town halls and joined us at our Vineyard Impact fair, April 25th where they shared more with the community. The design of the firehouse is now on its way to the planning commission. We look forward to the development and were given a timeline of 9 months after approvals. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
