<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In addition to the firehouse project, we're gearing up for other exciting economic development initiatives that will shape the future of our city. From supporting local businesses to fostering innovation and entrepreneurship, these efforts will contribute to the prosperity and vibrancy of our community. )
/E (In addition to the firehouse project, we're gearing up for other exciting economic development initiatives that will shape the future of our city. From supporting local businesses to fostering innovation and entrepreneurship, these efforts will contribute to the prosperity and vibrancy of our community. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Over the past nine months, our dedicated team has collaborated with Leland Consulting to craft a comprehensive strategic plan aimed at ensuring economic prosperity for our city. This initiative is designed to offer potential new businesses a clear understanding of our community's current state and its envisioned future.)
/E (Over the past nine months, our dedicated team has collaborated with Leland Consulting to craft a comprehensive strategic plan aimed at ensuring economic prosperity for our city. This initiative is designed to offer potential new businesses a clear understanding of our community's current state and its envisioned future.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The strategic plan not only serves as a roadmap for prospective businesses but also equips our staff and elected leaders with valuable tools and insights. By identifying industries that align with our community's needs and providing guidance on how to effectively promote them, this plan empowers us to make informed decisions that drive sustainable economic growth.)
/E (The strategic plan not only serves as a roadmap for prospective businesses but also equips our staff and elected leaders with valuable tools and insights. By identifying industries that align with our community's needs and providing guidance on how to effectively promote them, this plan empowers us to make informed decisions that drive sustainable economic growth.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
