/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (We will see this come before the council in the near future and are excited about the opportunities this strategic plan presents and look forward to the positive impact it will have on our city's economic landscape and the resources that it will provide to ensure excellent city services such as this new fire station.)
/E (We will see this come before the council in the near future and are excited about the opportunities this strategic plan presents and look forward to the positive impact it will have on our city's economic landscape and the resources that it will provide to ensure excellent city services such as this new fire station.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
