286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Municipal clerks \(recorders\) play a vital role in the functioning of local government, often serving as the backbone of administrative operations. Their extensive knowledge of law, procedures, and interpersonal relations is indispensable in maintaining efficient governance.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The recognition of Municipal Clerks Week by President Reagan and subsequent presidents underscores the significance of this profession in the smooth operation of municipalities across the United States and beyond. It's fitting to take this time to reflect on the contributions of municipal clerks and express appreciation for their dedication and hard work.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
288 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Here's to all the municipal clerks who diligently serve their communities, often behind the scenes, ensuring that local government functions effectively. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
289 0 obj
<<
