430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Wearing a helmet that fits well every time you're on a bike, scooter or skateboard helps protect your face, head, and brain if you fall. That's why it's so important to wear your bike helmet whenever you are on a bike.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Bike helmets are so important that the U.S. government has created safety rules for them. Your helmet should have a sticker that says it meets the rules set by the Consumer Product Safety Commission \(CPSC\). If your helmet doesn't have a CPSC sticker, ask your mom or dad to get you one that does.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Wear a bike helmet every time you ride, even if you're going for a short ride. And follow these rules:)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 705 0 R
/ActualText (Make sure your bike helmet fits you well.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 706 0 R
/ActualText (Always wear your helmet the right way so it will protect you: Make sure it covers your forehead and don't let it tip back. Always fasten the straps.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 707 0 R
/ActualText (Don't wear a hat under your helmet.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 708 0 R
/ActualText (Take care of your helmet and don't throw it around. If it's damaged, it won't protect you as well when you need it.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 709 0 R
/ActualText (Get a new helmet if you fall while you're on your bike and hit your head.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 710 0 R
/ActualText (Put reflective stickers on your helmet so drivers can see you better.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
